11665 0 obj
  << /ActualText (This report covers the security review for Zharta\056 This audit covered updated contracts of Zharta\031s peer\055to\055peer lending protocol for ERC20 tokens\056\nOur security assessment was a full review of the new code\054 spanning a total of 3 days\056\nDuring our review\054 we identified 2 High severity vulnerabilities that could have resulted in a loss of principal assets\056\nWe also identified several minor vulnerabilities and code optimizations\056\nAll reported issues were fixed by the development team and subsequently verified by us\056\240\nWe can confidently say that the overall security and code quality have increased after completion of our audit\056\240)
     /K [ 3 ]
     /P 11666 0 R
     /Pg 769 0 R
     /S /Span
     /Type /StructElem
  >>
endobj

