  << /ActualText (External price oracles such as Chainlink are designed to return positive price values under normal operation\056 However\054 due to round finalization delays\054 node consensus failures\054 feed interruptions\054 stale round reads\054 or temporary oracle outages\054 there exists a non\055zero probability that latestRoundData\050\051\056answer may return 0\056\nBecause \137get\137oracle\137rate\050\051 does not validate that answer \076 0\054 a rare oracle malfunction returning 0 can propagate into the LTV computation\056 When oracle\137reverse\075True\054 this results in\072\ndenominator \075 answer \075 0\nLTV calculation evaluating to 0\nLoan approval despite zero effective collateral value\nThis creates a scenario where a transient oracle anomaly can lead to fully uncollateralized loans and total lender fund loss\056)
     /K [ 23 ]
     /P 12128 0 R
     /Pg 11240 0 R
     /S /Span
     /Type /StructElem
  >>
endobj

